<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GF Prop issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>GF Prop issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Fields Property Company Ltd on Wednesday advised shareholders to continue exercising caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>This follows a cautionary announcement on January 29.</p>
<p>The group is a member of the Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd group.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
